<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23865" root="صخد" body-key="S">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخِدَ النَّهَارُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَ</span></b> , (S, L, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدٌ</span>
(S, L) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَانٌ</span>, (L,) <i>The day was,</i> or <i>became, intensely hot.</i> (S, L, K.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخِدَ الحَرُّ</span>,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَانٌ</span>, <i>The heat was,</i> or <i>became, intense;</i>
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصخد</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِصْخَادٌ</span>. (L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَتْهُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّمْسُ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَ</span></b> , (S, L, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخْدٌ</span>, (S, L,)
<i>The sun smote him,</i> (S, L,) and <i>burned him:</i> (S,
L, K:) or <i>was,</i> or <i>became, hot upon him.</i> (L.)
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَهُ الحَرُّ</span> <i>The heat pained his brain.</i> (A.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَ</span> said of the [bird called] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُرَد</span>, (S, L, K,)
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخْدٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخِيدٌ</span>, (L,) <i>It cried:</i>
(S, L, K:) and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَت</span> said of the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَامَة</span> [or
owl]. (A, L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَ إِلَيْهِ</span>, (L, K,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَخَدَ</span></b> , (L,)
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُخُودٌ</span>, <i>He listened to him,</i> (L, K,) and
<i>inclined to him.</i> (L.)

